{
  "description": "R13: with the login_item fixture driving the automation seam, toggling launch-at-login on records a register call and a11y shows the resulting status (Enabled; Requires approval and Not found with their explanations), the shown status survives a restart, and toggling off records an unregister call and shows Not registered",
  "requirement": "R13 (GPUI Phase 1), D6",
  "notes": [
    "Ruling R-o / D6: in automation builds the view's SMAppService status/register/unregister go through crate::login_item (status(), register(), unregister()), fed by the login_item fixture, so no real login item is ever registered on the host (O4). The real SMAppService round trip is an attended Phase 2 check.",
    "The fixture copy is the instance's login-item store: the seam rewrites its status and appends each call to its `calls` list, so the status survives a restart (fixtures are replayed with the same path) and the `file` steps read back exactly which calls the view made.",
    "The status label's text is exactly one of Enabled, Requires approval, Not registered, Not found; requires-approval and not-found also show the seam's explanation verbatim. The switch is on for Enabled and Requires approval (registered), off for Not registered and Not found (README contract).",
    "Reached with Tab (key_until) and toggled with Space. Settings re-reads the status each time it is shown."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "fixtures": {
      "login_item": "login-item-enabled.json"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "open settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: starts off, Not registered (from the seam)",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not registered",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: no seam call yet",
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-enabled.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "exists": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: Tab to Launch at login",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Switch",
        "text": "Launch at login",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: toggle on",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "space"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: shows Enabled",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": true
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Enabled",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-enabled.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "status": "enabled"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "enabled: one register call recorded"
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: restart",
      "restart": true
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: open settings after restart",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: still Enabled after the restart",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": true
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Enabled",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled off: Tab to Launch at login",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Switch",
        "text": "Launch at login",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: toggle off",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "space"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "enabled: shows Not registered",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not registered",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-enabled.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register",
            "unregister"
          ]
        },
        "status": "not_registered"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "enabled: unregister call recorded"
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: load its fixture",
      "call": "load_fixture",
      "args": {
        "kind": "login_item",
        "path": "{fixtures}/login-item-requires-approval.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: close settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": false,
        "route": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: reopen settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: starts Not registered",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not registered",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: Tab to Launch at login",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Switch",
        "text": "Launch at login",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: toggle on",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "space"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: shows the status with its explanation",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": true
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Requires approval",
          "exact": true
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "macOS needs your approval: turn on Ubilink in System Settings > General > Login Items.",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-requires-approval.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "status": "requires_approval"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "requires approval: register call recorded"
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: restart",
      "restart": true
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: open settings after restart",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: same status and explanation after the restart",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": true
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Requires approval",
          "exact": true
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "macOS needs your approval: turn on Ubilink in System Settings > General > Login Items.",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval off: Tab to Launch at login",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Switch",
        "text": "Launch at login",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: toggle off",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "space"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "requires approval: shows Not registered, explanation gone",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not registered",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "see": {
        "text": "macOS needs your approval: turn on Ubilink in System Settings > General > Login Items."
      },
      "absent": true,
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-requires-approval.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register",
            "unregister"
          ]
        },
        "status": "not_registered"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "requires approval: unregister call recorded"
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: load its fixture",
      "call": "load_fixture",
      "args": {
        "kind": "login_item",
        "path": "{fixtures}/login-item-not-found.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: close settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": false,
        "route": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: reopen settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: Tab to Launch at login",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Switch",
        "text": "Launch at login",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: toggle on",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "space"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: shows the status with its explanation, switch back off",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not found",
          "exact": true
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "macOS cannot find this copy of Ubilink as a login item. Move Ubilink to Applications, open it from there and try again.",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-not-found.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "status": "not_found"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "not found: register call recorded"
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: restart",
      "restart": true
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: open settings after restart",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not found: same status and explanation after the restart",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Switch",
          "text": "Launch at login",
          "state": {
            "toggled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Not found",
          "exact": true
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "macOS cannot find this copy of Ubilink as a login item. Move Ubilink to Applications, open it from there and try again.",
          "exact": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "file": "{fixtures}/login-item-not-found.json",
      "expect": {
        "calls": {
          "eq": [
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "status": "not_found"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "name": "not found: no further seam call"
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing launched",
      "call": "opened",
      "expect": {
        "": {
          "eq": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
